      potentialCatalysts: ["Successful and widely adopted NU7 network upgrade.", "Significant de-escalation of US-Iran geopolitical tensions.", "Sustained period of US dollar weakness and lower Treasury yields.", "Increased institutional demand for privacy-preserving digital assets."],
