      neutralCase: "The crypto market is in a transitional phase, balancing the promise of institutional adoption with the challenges of regulatory oversight and market maturity. While RWA tokenization offers a clear path for growth, regulatory actions and market corrections will continue to shape the landscape, leading to a period of consolidation and refinement rather than explosive growth or widespread collapse.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a 55% probability of a \'Neutral-to-Mildly Bullish\' outcome, driven by continued institutional integration and RWA growth, offset by a 30% probability of a \'Bearish\' outcome due to regulatory tightening and market volatility, and a 15% probability of a \'Strongly Bullish\' outcome if institutional adoption accelerates unexpectedly and regulatory clarity emerges rapidly.",
      potentialCatalysts: ["Further adoption of RWA tokenization by other major financial institutions.", "Clear and favorable regulatory frameworks from key jurisdictions.", "Significant technological advancements improving blockchain scalability and security.", "Resolution of macroeconomic uncertainties, leading to increased risk appetite."],
