    featuredImagePrompt: "A professional editorial news layout. On the left side, a stylized depiction of a modern financial institution building (representing Morgan Stanley) with subtle glowing blockchain lines emanating from it, symbolizing Real World Asset (RWA) tokenization. On the right side, a downward-trending cryptocurrency price chart (representing Bitcoin\'s dip) overlaid with abstract regulatory symbols like scales of justice or a subtle G-man silhouette, and a small, distinct, non-trademarked geometric logo that evokes \'Block\' without being the actual logo. The overall color palette should be professional, with blues, greens, and grays, with a touch of digital glow. The composition should be split, showing the contrast between institutional adoption and regulatory/market challenges.",
