    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual, high-resolution visual representing the complex challenges and innovations in the cryptocurrency market. Focus on abstract elements: a glowing, secure blockchain network forming a protective shield, but with visible cracks or glitches symbolizing the Binance hack. In the background, faint, ethereal quantum computing circuits loom as a future threat. In the foreground, stylized scales or a thought bubble containing ambiguous historical symbols (e.g., a question mark, a broken clock) symbolize Verifact Markets\' \'disputed facts\' concept. The overall color palette should be dark and futuristic with vibrant digital accents, creating a sense of both danger and opportunity. No direct logos, text, or human figures. Unsplash/DALL-E style, high detail, dynamic composition.",
