    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split image. On one side, Bitcoin\'s stylized logo overlaid on a downward trending stock chart, representing market headwinds and volatility. On the other side, a subtle, ethereal depiction of shimmering gold dust transforming from a liquid (mercury-like), symbolizing the alchemy claim, with Bitcoin\'s symbol subtly integrated into the gold, emphasizing the \'digital gold\' narrative. The overall composition should convey market tension, the interplay of digital and traditional assets, and the philosophical debate of scarcity, using a sophisticated, financial news aesthetic with a neutral color palette of blues, grays, and subtle gold accents.",
