    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the dual pressures on Bitcoin. On one side, abstract graphics depicting geopolitical tension: stylized red and orange energy waves, subtle military silhouettes, and a sense of global instability. On the other side, subtle elements representing corporate finance: a stack of stylized coins or digital ledger lines, a faint graph, and a sense of structured accumulation. The two sides are distinct but visually linked by a central, slightly distressed Bitcoin logo, symbolizing its position between these forces. The overall mood should be sophisticated and thought-provoking, avoiding literal depictions of conflict. Use a cool blue and gray palette for the corporate side, contrasting with warm, urgent tones for geopolitical tension.",
