      neutralCase: "The current environment reflects a market in transition, balancing efforts to integrate crypto into traditional financial systems (IRS) with the inherent risks of a nascent technology (Initia exploit) and the cautious approach of regulators (SEC on tokenization). This creates a mixed bag of opportunities and challenges, pushing the industry towards greater maturity and compliance.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a medium probability (50%) of continued regulatory tightening and security challenges, a moderate probability (30%) of positive long-term growth driven by compliance and tokenization, and a lower probability (20%) of significant market disruption from unforeseen exploits or overly restrictive regulations. The weighted outlook suggests a cautious but evolving market.",
