    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual depicting the convergence of traditional finance and cryptocurrency. On one side, a stylized, glowing Bitcoin symbol with intertwined lines representing loans and yield. On the other side, abstract digital representations of real-world assets like a house, a stock chart, and a gold bar, seamlessly merging into a blockchain ledger. In the background, subtle elements of regulatory frameworks (like a gavel or scales of justice) are partially visible, suggesting ongoing oversight. The overall aesthetic should be modern, clean, and professional, using a palette of blues, greens, and digital golds, with a sense of forward momentum and transformation. The image should convey sophistication and the bridging of two financial worlds.",
