      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A neutral-to-slightly bearish outlook is most probable. While Binance.US\'s funding efforts are positive, the significant hurdle of regulatory uncertainty, amplified by the White House vacancy, creates substantial headwinds. The probability of swift and favorable regulatory clarity is low, making a rapid recovery for Binance.US challenging despite potential capital infusion.",
